Package: freracer
Version: @VERSION@
Section: user/games
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: python2.5, python-pygame
Maintainer: David Carroll <CarrollD@newschool.edu>
Homepage: https://github.com/profcarroll/freracer
XSBC-Bugtracker: https://github.com/profcarroll/freracer/issues
XB-Maemo-Display-Name: freracer
Description: pseudo-3D accelerometer racer for the N900
 A scanline pseudo-3D racer in the tradition of Pole Position and OutRun,
 steered with the N900's accelerometer - tilt left and right, no touchscreen
 driving controls, throttle is automatic. Curbs, obstacles and traffic buzz
 the vibrator.
 .
 The desktop icon starts a journey: an endless, seeded, procedurally
 generated drive through changing regions. Two finite courses also ship,
 one hand-built and one designed by a self-hosted language model.
 .
 Built for PSAM 5600 B, Small Linux Devices, Large Language Models
 (Parsons, Fall 2026).
